      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼……\n我們一起歡度第<U+0010><U+0003>ȅ<U+0002><U+0000>戰的美好時光吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
