      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳準備好時，\n請隨時告訴我一聲吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
