      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E0D60F362534E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我們只攜手共度了<U+0010><U+0003>ȅ<U+0002><U+0000>戰呢。\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳已經要放棄了嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
